      "description": "Bring your local, cloud and NAS music into one Hi-Res player.\nEver Play gives you control of your own library, with lossless audio, DSD playback, offline caching and detailed output options for external DACs.\n\nBuilt for listeners who collect FLAC, ALAC, WAV, APE or DSD files and want to enjoy them without depending on a streaming catalog.\n\nEverplay supports all popular formats including Hi-Res ones. \n\nOne of the most important feature of Everplay is that it support DSD(up to 11.2MHz，aka. DSD256) playback, in term of PCM and DoP. When PCM mode is selected, DSD is converted to and output as PCM. When DoP mode is selected, DSD is outputted as DSD over PCM.(Connected device must be DoP-compatible to this mode, otherwise, DSD will be outputed as PCM even DoP mode is selected.)\n\nEverplay support up to 384kHz/32bit music file and upsampling output Mode, you can select custom output sample rate to playback. It can automatically choose the max support format to playback, so you never need to worry about output device change.\n\nEverplay support Wi-Fi transfer, iTunes files sharing and Airdrop. Through Wi-Fi Transfer, you can share music files between computer and Everplay app with browser.\n\n• Google Drive\n• 115 Drive\n• Aliyun Drive\n• Baidu Yun Drive\n• One Drive\n• SMB1/2/3\n• WebDAV\n• Tencent WeiYun\n• 123 Drive\n• dropbox\n• navidrome\n• pCloud\n\n• FLAC(MQA), APE, WAV, ALAC(M4A), AIFF, AIF, MP3, WMA, OGG, AAC,DTS\n• SACD(ISO), DSF, DFF(DSD64, DSD128 and DSD256 support both PCM and DoP output mode)\n• CUE(Sheet)\n\n[Music Management and Easy Transfer]\n• WiFi Music Transfer (Http)\n• iTunes Files Sharing\n• Playlist Management\n• Files Management\n• Airdrop\n\n[Advanced Features]\n• Support Aliyun Drive, Weiyun, Baidu net-disk, OneDrive authorization and SMB, WebDAV connection.\n• Support load music from iTune library\n• Support Carplay feature\n• Thousand of visualizations embedded in player which beat with music,It's one of the most advanced visualizer in the App Store.\n• Playback Hi-Res audio source up to 32bit/384kHz\n• Playback DSD audio source up to 11.2MHz\n• Visualizer\n• Hundred settings of EQ with random play\n• Random EQ for each song when playing\n• Searching songs\n• Display song and connected device information\n• Upsampling function\n• Sleep timer\n• Disable Auto-lock Screen\n• Auto-download Album/Artist Image(On/OFF)\n• DSD to PCM\n• Dop(DSD over PCM)\n• Custom Output Sample Rate\n• Redesign the Player Interface and Interaction\n• Online lyrics\n• Gapless playback\n• Resample rate Algorithm\n• Variable Playback Rate\n• Fast Forward and Fast Backward\n• A→B repeat play\n• Siri Play\n• Shortcut Play\n• iPadOS Multiple Windows Support\n\nURL Scheme: FancyMusicPlayer\n\nSubscription name: Hi-Res&DSD(Yearly)\nSubscription duration: One year\nTerms of Use: You can read your terms of use here for more details: http://www.appgreat.com/FancyTermsOfUse/\nAuto-renewing subscription: You subscription will be renewed every one year. i.e. you will be charged every year.\n\n– Price may vary by location.\n– Payment will be charged to iTunes Account at confirmation of purchase\n– Subscription automatically renews unless auto-renew is turned off at least 24-hours before the end of the current period\n– Account will be charged for renewal within 24-hours prior to the end of the current period, and identify the cost of the renewal\n– Subscriptions may be managed by the user and auto-renewal may be turned off by going to the user's Account Settings after purchase\n– Any unused portion of a free trial period, if offered, will be forfeited when the user purchases a subscription to that publication, where applicable\n\n※Please note that Everplay is a pure music player. You should put the song to the app documents directory by the means of throung iTunes File Sharing or Wi-Fi sharing or connect to your cloud account to play it.",
